            "created": "2024-09-02T08:45:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>Since the 2.1.0 upgrade our VAT invoice exports show blank totals. Finance is blocked on reconciliation.</p>"
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Ravi Menon" },
            "created": "2024-09-05T09:05:00.000+0000",
