            "author": { "displayName": "Ravi Menon" },
            "created": "2024-09-21T10:05:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>Resolved in 2.1.3; totals verified on our side.</p>"
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Maya Rao" },
            "created": "2024-09-26T14:32:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>Reopened: the finance sandbox still shows blank VAT totals on 2.1.3.</p>"
