    {
      "key": "ORB-150",
      "self": "https://orbit.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/ORB-150",
      "fields": {
        "summary": "BILLING-V2: VAT rounding regression",
        "status": { "name": "In Progress" },
        "created": "2024-09-10T11:00:00.000+0000",
        "reporter": { "displayName": "Ravi Menon" }
      },
      "comment": {
        "comments": [
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Maya Rao" },
            "created": "2024-09-24T16:20:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>The BILLING-V2 refactor moved VAT rounding to integer math in 2.1.0, which drops fractional cents and blanks the export totals. That change is still unreviewed.</p>"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "ORB-140",
      "self": "https://orbit.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/ORB-140",
      "fields": {
        "summary": "SSO login fails for Contoso finance users",
        "status": { "name": "Resolved" },
        "created": "2024-09-18T09:20:00.000+0000",
        "reporter": { "displayName": "Dana Okafor" }
      },
      "changelog": {
        "histories": [
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Leo Park" },
            "created": "2024-09-18T10:00:00.000+0000",
            "items": [{ "field": "status", "fromString": "Open", "toString": "In Progress" }]
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Leo Park" },
            "created": "2024-09-26T11:00:00.000+0000",
            "items": [{ "field": "status", "fromString": "In Progress", "toString": "Resolved" }]
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Maya Rao" },
            "created": "2024-09-30T10:00:00.000+0000",
            "items": [{ "field": "status", "fromString": "Resolved", "toString": "Resolved" }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "comment": {
        "comments": [
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Dana Okafor" },
            "created": "2024-09-18T09:25:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>Finance users cannot sign in since the identity migration; the SSO error is AADSTS50011.</p>"
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Leo Park" },
            "created": "2024-09-18T10:05:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>We will ship the SSO fix in the Sep 26 release.</p>"
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Leo Park" },
            "created": "2024-09-26T11:05:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>Resolved; the identity migration is complete.</p>"
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Dana Okafor" },
            "created": "2024-09-27T08:10:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>Still failing for finance. This is not fixed.</p>"
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Sam Ortiz" },
            "created": "2024-09-29T15:30:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>The identity-service 3.4 migration dropped the SAML signing certificate; that is why SSO fails. Fixed in 3.4.1.</p>"
          },
          {
            "author": { "displayName": "Maya Rao" },
            "created": "2024-09-30T10:05:00.000+0000",
            "body": "<p>Verified SSO with Contoso finance; closing.</p>"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
